"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"அது","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"பொய்ப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"பொய்","lemma":"பொய்","gloss":"fail/lie"},{"text":"பின்","lemma":"பின்","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if [he] fails"},{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"எவன்","parts":[{"text":"எவன்","lemma":"எவன்","gloss":"what"}],"gloss":"what"},{"surface":"செய்கோ","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"do"},{"text":"கோ","lemma":"கோ","gloss":"question particle"}],"gloss":"shall I do"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தினைத்தாள்","parts":[{"text":"தினை","lemma":"தினை","gloss":"millet"},{"text":"தாள்","lemma":"தாள்","gloss":"stem"}],"gloss":"millet stem"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"சிறுபசுங்கால","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"},{"text":"பசுமை","lemma":"பசுமை","gloss":"green"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"leg"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having small green legs"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒழுகுநீர்","parts":[{"text":"ஒழுகு","lemma":"ஒழுகு","gloss":"flow"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"flowing water"},{"surface":"ஆரல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆரல்","lemma":"ஆரல்","gloss":"aaral fish"}],"gloss":"aaral fish"},{"surface":"பார்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"பார்க்கும்","lemma":"பார்க்கும்","gloss":"watching"}],"gloss":"watching","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குருகும்","parts":[{"text":"குருகு","lemma":"குருகு","gloss":"heron"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"only a heron"},{"surface":"உண்டு","parts":[{"text":"உண்டு","lemma":"உண்டு","gloss":"existed"}],"gloss":"existed"},{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"மணந்த","parts":[{"text":"மணந்த","lemma":"மணந்த","gloss":"united"}],"gloss":"united","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஞான்றே","parts":[{"text":"ஞான்று","lemma":"ஞான்று","gloss":"time"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"at the very time"}]}],"literal":"No one else was there; he himself, the thief. / If he denies that, what shall I do? / Like a millet stem, with small green legs, / watching the aaral fish in the flowing water, / only a heron was there at the time he united with me.","translation":"There was no one else there, only he, the thief. If he denies it now, what can I do? At the very time he united with me, there was only a heron with small green legs like millet stems, watching for aaral fish in the flowing water.","modern":"அங்கு வேறு யாரும் இல்லை; அவன் மட்டுமே கள்வன். அவன் தன் வாக்கை மறுத்தால் நான் என்ன செய்வேன்? தினைத் தட்டை போன்ற சிறிய பசிய கால்களை உடைய, ஓடுகின்ற நீரில் ஆரல் மீனை நோக்குகின்ற நாரை மட்டுமே அவன் என்னை மணந்த பொழுது அங்கு இருந்தது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante in the kuṟiñci landscape. The hero has made promises of marriage during their secret meetings but has now delayed, and she fears he might deny them. She laments that there were no human witnesses to their union, only the hero and a heron. The heron, however, was not paying attention to them; it was entirely focused on catching the aaral fish in the running water. This image of the heron waiting for its prey reflects the hero's focused intent on his own pleasure while being oblivious to her future suffering, and highlights her helplessness as she has no witness to prove his promise.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}